# import_brace_binds_module - a brace import binds its module as a plain import does: with only `import IbbmA::Toml::{ one };`, `Toml::one()` reaches the module by path and `Toml::Sub::three()` loads `IbbmA::Toml::Sub`, which nothing imports.
